{"name":"Infusion","hex":"#c8d0ca","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"infusion","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A product consisting of a liquid which has had other ingredients steeped in it to extract useful qualities.","The act of steeping or soaking a substance in liquid so as to extract medicinal or herbal qualities."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/infusion"}],"entries":[{"title":"Infusion","blocks":[{"text":"Infusion is the process of extracting chemical compounds or flavors from plant material in a solvent – such as water, oil, or alcohol –, by allowing the material to remain suspended in the solvent over time. \"Infusion\" is also the name for the resultant fluid mixture. The process of infusion is distinct from both decoction, a method of extraction involving boiling the plant material, and percolation, in which water is passed through the material."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/CoffeeBeansWhiteBackground.jpg/330px-CoffeeBeansWhiteBackground.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infusion","wikidata":"Q61951"},{"title":"Infusion (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Infusion was an Australian electronica band, originally from Wollongong which formed in 1995. It is best known for its ARIA Music Award-winning song \"Girls Can Be Cruel\" and Six Feet Above Yesterday."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Infusion4.jpg/330px-Infusion4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infusion_(band)","wikidata":"Q12060745"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/A_small_cup_of_coffee.JPG/500px-A_small_cup_of_coffee.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/A_small_cup_of_coffee.JPG/1280px-A_s